sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as User Browser / MLflow SDK
    participant GW as ODH Data Science Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (/mlflow)
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server Pod<br/>5000/TCP HTTPS (in-pod TLS)
    participant Auth as kubernetes-auth plugin<br/>(in-process)
    participant WS as kubernetes:// workspace provider<br/>(in-process)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3-compatible Store<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: User / SDK API request
    Client->>GW: HTTPS /mlflow/api/2.0/mlflow/...<br/>Bearer token / platform session
    GW->>MLflow: HTTPS 5000 (re-encrypt)<br/>Bearer + X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE
    MLflow->>Auth: Host/CORS checks passed
    Auth->>K8s: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>mlflow.kubeflow.org pseudo-resource<br/>caller's token
    K8s-->>Auth: allowed / denied
    Auth->>PG: Query scoped to workspace<br/>DB credentials, TLS if configured
    PG-->>MLflow: Rows
    MLflow-->>GW: JSON response
    GW-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Artifact upload/download (--serve-artifacts)
    Client->>GW: PUT/GET /api/2.0/mlflow-artifacts/artifacts/...<br/>Bearer
    GW->>MLflow: HTTPS 5000
    MLflow->>K8s: SSAR (caller's token)
    MLflow->>WS: Resolve artifact root
    WS->>K8s: Read MLflowConfig<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>WS: artifact-root override (optional)
    MLflow->>S3: Stream object<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, AWS keys / IAM
    S3-->>MLflow: OK / object bytes
    MLflow-->>Client: Response (via gateway)

    Note over WS,K8s: Flow 3: Workspace discovery
    WS->>K8s: list/watch namespaces<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>WS: Namespace events
    Client->>GW: GET workspaces (UI / SDK)<br/>Bearer
    GW->>MLflow: HTTPS 5000
    MLflow->>K8s: SSAR per namespace (caller's token)
    MLflow-->>Client: Only workspaces caller can access
